msgid "Webhook URL"
msgstr "URL веб-хука"

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1356
msgid "Secret"
msgstr "Секрет"

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1362
msgid "Copy the secret now: it is not shown again."
msgstr "Скопируйте секрет сейчас: он больше не будет показан."

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1366
msgid ""
"In the repository on GitHub, open Settings, then Webhooks, then Add "
"webhook."
msgstr ""
"В репозитории на GitHub откройте Settings, затем Webhooks, затем Add "
"webhook."

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1367
msgid ""
"Paste the webhook URL into Payload URL and set Content type to "
"application/json."
msgstr ""
"Вставьте URL веб-хука в поле Payload URL и выберите Content type "
"application/json."

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1368
#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1384
msgid "Paste the secret into Secret."
msgstr "Вставьте секрет в поле Secret."

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1369
msgid ""
"Choose \"Let me select individual events\", tick Pushes and Pull "
"requests, and save. GitHub sends a ping at once; it appears in the "
"delivery log."
msgstr ""
"Выберите «Let me select individual events», отметьте Pushes и Pull "
"requests и сохраните. GitHub сразу отправит ping — он появится в журнале "
"доставки."

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1374
msgid ""
"In the project on GitLab, open Settings, then Webhooks, then Add new "
"webhook."
msgstr ""
"В проекте на GitLab откройте Settings, затем Webhooks, затем Add new "
"webhook."

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1375
msgid "Paste the webhook URL into URL and the secret into Secret token."
msgstr "Вставьте URL веб-хука в поле URL, а секрет — в поле Secret token."

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1376
msgid "Under Trigger, select Push events and Merge request events."
msgstr "В разделе Trigger выберите Push events и Merge request events."

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1377
msgid "Save, then use Test, Push events to send a first delivery."
msgstr ""
"Сохраните, затем нажмите Test → Push events, чтобы отправить первую "
"доставку."

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1382
msgid ""
"In the repository, open Settings, then Webhooks, then Add webhook, and "
"pick the Gitea or Forgejo webhook type, matching the server."
msgstr ""
"В репозитории откройте Settings, затем Webhooks, затем Add webhook и "
"выберите тип веб-хука Gitea или Forgejo — в зависимости от сервера."

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1383
msgid ""
"Paste the webhook URL into Target URL. Keep the HTTP method POST and set "
"the POST content type to application/json."
msgstr ""
"Вставьте URL веб-хука в поле Target URL. Оставьте метод HTTP POST и "
"выберите POST content type application/json."

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1385
msgid ""
"Under Trigger on, choose Custom events, tick Push and Pull request, then "
"add the webhook. Test delivery sends a push."
msgstr ""
"В разделе Trigger on выберите Custom events, отметьте Push и Pull "
"request, затем добавьте веб-хук. Test delivery отправит push."

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1403
msgid "No repositories connected"
msgstr "Нет подключённых репозиториев"

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1404
msgid ""
"Connect a GitHub, GitLab, Gitea or Forgejo repository: commits that "
"mention an issue key, such as \"Fixes KEY-12\", or are pushed to a branch"
" named after one, are linked to the issue."
msgstr ""
"Подключите репозиторий GitHub, GitLab, Gitea или Forgejo: коммиты, в "
"которых упомянут ключ задачи (например, «Fixes KEY-12») или отправленные "
"в ветку, названную по ключу, будут связаны с задачей."

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1405
msgid "Connect the first repository"
msgstr "Подключить первый репозиторий"

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1418
msgid "Last delivery:"
msgstr "Последняя доставка:"

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1419
msgid "includes subprojects"
msgstr "включая подпроекты"

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1421
msgid "commit commands on"
msgstr "команды в коммитах включены"

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1422
msgid "merge automation on"
msgstr "автоматизация слияний включена"

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1427
msgid "New secret"
msgstr "Новый секрет"

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1460
msgid "Deliveries appear here once the forge sends its first webhook to this URL."
msgstr ""
"Доставки появятся здесь, когда Git-хостинг отправит на этот URL первый "
"веб-хук."

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1510
msgid "Repository URL"
msgstr "URL репозитория"

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1513
msgid ""
"Paste the address of the repository's page, or its clone address. "
"Provider and Repository are filled in from it."
msgstr ""

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1517
msgid "Undo"
msgstr ""

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1534
msgid "Repository"
msgstr "Репозиторий"

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1537
msgid ""
"The full name as the forge shows it, owner and repository. Deliveries "
"that name another repository are ignored."
msgstr ""
"Полное имя в том виде, как его показывает Git-хостинг: владелец и "
"репозиторий. Доставки для другого репозитория игнорируются."

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1540
msgid "Issues commits may link to"
msgstr "Задачи, с которыми могут связываться коммиты"

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1542
msgid "This project"
msgstr "Этот проект"

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1543
msgid "This project and its subprojects"
msgstr "Этот проект и его подпроекты"

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1545
msgid "Keys of other projects in commit messages are ignored."
msgstr "Ключи других проектов в сообщениях коммитов игнорируются."

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1548
msgid "Changes to issues"
msgstr "Изменения задач"

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1549
msgid ""
"Commit commands trust the commit author email, which anyone with push "
"access can set to any address. With commands on, anyone who can push to "
"this repository can act as any project member whose verified email they "
"use."
msgstr ""
"Команды в коммитах доверяют email автора коммита, а его любой, у кого "
"есть право push, может указать произвольно. Когда команды включены, "
"любой, кто может отправлять изменения в этот репозиторий, может "
"действовать от имени любого участника проекта, чей подтверждённый email "
"он укажет."

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1552
msgid "Commit commands"
msgstr "Команды в коммитах"

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1554
msgid ""
"\"Fixes KEY-12\" in a commit on the default branch moves the issue to the"
" fixing status, as the Specivo user whose verified email wrote the "
"commit. Their permissions and the workflow apply."
msgstr ""
"«Fixes KEY-12» в коммите в ветке по умолчанию переводит задачу в статус "
"исправления от имени пользователя Specivo, чей подтверждённый email "
"указан в коммите. Действуют его права и рабочий процесс."

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1556
msgid "Fixing status"
msgstr "Статус исправления"

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1558
msgid "Do not change the status"
msgstr "Не менять статус"

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1566
msgid "Time logging"
msgstr "Учёт времени"

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1568
msgid ""
"\"KEY-12 @1h30m\" (also @2h, @90m, @1.5h) logs the time on the issue for "
"the commit's author, on any branch. They need permission to log time."
msgstr ""
"«KEY-12 @1h30m» (а также @2h, @90m, @1.5h) учитывает время в задаче за "
"автором коммита, в любой ветке. Нужно право на учёт времени."

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1572
msgid "Merge automation"
msgstr "Автоматизация слияний"

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1574
msgid ""
"When a pull or merge request that says \"Fixes KEY-12\" is merged into "
"the default branch, the issue moves to the merge status. The change is "
"made by Git, with the project role chosen here, and follows the workflow."
msgstr ""
"Когда pull request или merge request с текстом «Fixes KEY-12» сливается в"
" ветку по умолчанию, задача переходит в статус слияния. Изменение "
"выполняет Git с выбранной здесь ролью в проекте, с соблюдением рабочего "
"процесса."

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1577
msgid "Merge status"
msgstr "Статус слияния"

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1579
msgid "Choose a status"
msgstr "Выберите статус"

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1587
msgid "Role of Git in this project"
msgstr "Роль Git в этом проекте"

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1593
msgid ""
"The Automation role may edit issues but has no workflow transitions until"
" an administrator grants them. Changing the role needs permission to "
"manage members."
msgstr ""
"Роль Automation может изменять задачи, но не имеет переходов рабочего "
"процесса, пока их не выдаст администратор. Для смены роли нужно право "
"управлять участниками."

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1599
msgid "Ignore pull requests from forks and outsiders"
msgstr "Игнорировать запросы на слияние из форков и от посторонних"

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1601
msgid ""
"Requests from another repository, or on GitHub by someone who is not a "
"collaborator, are not linked to issues until they are merged."
msgstr ""
"Запросы из другого репозитория или, на GitHub, от того, кто не является "
"соавтором (collaborator), не связываются с задачами, пока не будут слиты."

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1604
msgid "Environment types"
msgstr ""

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1605
msgid ""
"Deployments are grouped by environment type, guessed from the "
"environment's name (\"prod-eu\" is production). List the environments the"
" guess gets wrong. A name ending in * covers every environment that "
"starts with it, such as review/*. Names match in any case."
msgstr ""

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1610
msgid "Environment name or prefix*"
msgstr ""

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1611
msgid "e.g. github-pages or review/*"
msgstr ""

#: specivo/templates/themes/default/pages/projects/settings.html:1622
msgid "Choose a type"
msgstr ""

